// These stand in for types that really belong to a window-system header. Each is laid out
// to match the real one, so values pass back and forth with (for instance) Jai's Windows
// module without a cast.
//
// Everything here sits behind the platform parameter that needs it, so a build with no
// platform extensions turned on declares none of them.

